sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant E as ESTS
  participant U as User / Authenticator app
  Note over C,E: ConvergedTFA arrUserProofs contains PhoneAppOTP
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/BeginAuth  header canary
  Note over C,E: {AuthMethodId: PhoneAppOTP, Method: BeginAuth, ctx, flowToken}
  E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, FlowToken, Ctx, SessionId}
  U-->>C: TOTP code (out of band, from the app)
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/EndAuth (JSON)  header canary
  Note over C,E: {AdditionalAuthData: otp, AuthMethodId, SessionId, FlowToken, Ctx,<br/>Method: EndAuth}
  alt code accepted
    E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, FlowToken, Ctx}
    C->>E: POST /common/SAS/ProcessAuth (form)
    Note over C,E: request, mfaAuthMethod=PhoneAppOTP, login, flowToken, canary
    E-->>C: 302 code, or 200 interrupt HTML
  else code rejected
    E-->>C: 200 {Success: false, Retry: false, ErrCode}
  end
